ent, and gear all with unique stats-that will allow you to better survive the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRUTAL &amp; MATURE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261560/extras/27cfda6db4e132fbe00fb499af43a290.poster.avif?t=1784423402\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261560/extras/27cfda6db4e132fbe00fb499af43a290.webm?t=1784423402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261560/extras/27cfda6db4e132fbe00fb499af43a290.mp4?t=1784423402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and uncover the truth of a <strong>Mysterious</strong> and <strong>Broken</strong> world, filled with unique story elements and an abundance of <strong>hidden secrets</strong>. Traverse through <strong>sprawling forests, urban, residential, and industrial locations, including underground bunkers, nuclear facilities, and devastated cityscapes</strong> to discover what the <strong>Brutal</strong> world of <strong>WTP</strong> has to offer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WIPE BASED PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261560/extras/eb051a2cf86ec431e0cd5aeb0f7409f2.poster.avif?t=1784423402\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261560/extras/eb051a2cf86ec431e0cd5aeb0f7409f2.webm?t=1784423402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2261560/extras/eb051a2cf86ec431e0cd5aeb0f7409f2.mp4?t=1784423402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span